WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.824
Welcome to Computer Class. Today you will learn: Word: Page Setup and Print.

2
00:00:06.124 --> 00:00:10.413
Set up the page and print your document. Follow each step on your own computer.

3
00:00:11.417 --> 00:00:15.265
Step one. Click Layout, then Margins, then choose Normal.

4
00:00:16.250 --> 00:00:22.597
Step two. Click Orientation. Choose Portrait for a tall page, or Landscape for a wide page.

5
00:00:23.583 --> 00:00:29.489
Step three. Press Control and P to open Print. Look at the preview on the right to check your page.

6
00:00:30.483 --> 00:00:35.576
Step four. Choose your printer and the number of copies. Then click Print.

7
00:00:36.583 --> 00:00:40.037
Now it is your turn. Try these tasks on your own computer.

8
00:00:40.337 --> 00:00:42.569
Set Narrow margins on a document.

9
00:00:42.869 --> 00:00:45.240
Change the page to Landscape and back.

10
00:00:45.540 --> 00:00:47.911
Open Print Preview and check the page.

11
00:00:48.211 --> 00:00:49.235
Well done!

